# 🎟️ Decentralized Event Ticketing System (DApp)

A blockchain-based event ticketing platform designed to eliminate fraud, prevent duplication, and enable secure ticket ownership using NFTs.

---

## 📌 Overview

This project is a **Decentralized Application (DApp)** that allows event organizers to create events and users to securely purchase, verify, and manage tickets on the blockchain.

Each ticket is minted as an NFT, ensuring:
- Uniqueness
- Ownership transparency
- Tamper-proof validation

The platform also introduces advanced features such as **dynamic pricing** and **auction-based ticket allocation**, making it more aligned with real-world ticketing systems.

---

## 🚀 Key Features

### 🎫 NFT-Based Ticketing
- Each ticket is represented as an ERC-721 NFT
- Ensures uniqueness and prevents duplication
- Ownership securely stored on the blockchain

---

### 🛒 Ticket Purchase & Ownership
- Users can buy tickets using MetaMask
- Tickets are linked to wallet addresses
- Transparent ownership tracking

---

### 🔁 Ticket Resale Marketplace
- Users can resell tickets securely
- Ownership transfer handled via smart contracts
- Prevents fraud in secondary markets

---

### 📈 Dynamic Pricing System
- Ticket prices increase based on demand
- Early buyers get lower prices
- Late buyers pay higher prices
- Simulates real-world ticket pricing behavior

---

### 🔨 Auction System
- High-demand tickets can be auctioned
- Users place bids on tickets
- Highest bidder wins
- Transparent and decentralized bidding process

---

### ✅ Ticket Verification & Redemption
- QR code or blockchain-based validation
- Prevents ticket reuse
- Ensures authenticity at entry points

---

### 🛠 Admin Dashboard
- Create and manage events
- Monitor ticket sales and usage
- Manage users and transactions

---

## 🏗️ Tech Stack

### 🔗 Blockchain
- Solidity
- Ganache (Local Ethereum Network)
- MetaMask (Wallet Integration)

### 💻 Backend
- Django (Python)

### 🌐 Frontend
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript (Django Templates)

---

## 📂 Project Structure
Backend/ # Django core configuration
Users/ # User-related logic
Admins/ # Admin panel logic
templates/ # HTML templates (UI)
static/ # CSS, JS, assets
smartcontract/ # Solidity contracts

---

## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/fardeenk8/EventTicketingSystem.git
cd EventTicketingSystem

python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # Mac/Linux
venv\Scripts\activate      # Windows

## Install Dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

## Start Ganache
Open Ganache GUI
Start local blockchain
RPC URL: http://127.0.0.1:7545

## Connect MetaMask
Add Ganache network
Import accounts using private keys from Ganache

## Compile & Deploy Smart Contract
cd smartcontract
python compile_contract.py
python deploy_contract.py

## Run Database Migrations
python manage.py migrate

## Start Server
python manage.py runserver
Open in browser:
http://127.0.0.1:8000/

How It Works
Admin creates an event
Smart contract mints tickets as NFTs
Users purchase tickets via MetaMask
Tickets are stored in user wallets
Tickets can be:
Resold
Auctioned
Verified at event entry
